    "body": "## Problem\r\nThe `aupat_get_buflocal_nr` function uses unsafe standard extraction logic that can lead to silent integer overflows when parsing a string.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nReplace the parsing block with integer conversion that explicitly validates variable boundaries against `INT_MAX` before truncation.\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-06-27T23:09:00Z",
    "comment_data": [
